# env.c split_link: legs at 0 HP in any damage path (my_root, gas_hit, zone_tick, charge_contact_tick, sf_explode) with a
# living head that is not parked for a respawn -> a lethal hit on the head through my_root from the same attacker (or the
# root's owner index), without the hypercharge / status / gear modifiers (split_hit). One kill: record_event counts no kill
# on the legs and a kill but no hit on the head's linked hit; the attacker's super / hypercharge charge put back; nobody's
# hit (storm, meteor): no kill credit; the storm's legs death is the head's storm elimination and his lost HP storm damage;
# legs never take a gas_lethal_id slot. A knocked-out head (duo / trio, parked at full HP) takes his legs with him
# (superfix_split_drop). env.c split_gas: each storm second, living legs on a storm tile take 20 % of their max HP [?].
# respawn_tick: a teammate respawning on a split head's water spot goes to the nearest land (superfix_land).
# superfix_moves.c: superfix_split_legs / superfix_split_head / superfix_split_water / superfix_split_drop / superfix_land
# for env.c (the existing partner lookup and retire); canWalkOverWater 0xb51200 hooked (my_wow: a head with living legs
# walks over water; isSplit 0xb5a7b0's result is dropped by both callers), and env.c raycasts that head's joystick target
# past water (flag 0, as the client's 1 & ~0xb31e20); the rejoin goes to the nearest walkable spot of the live map (100 u
# rings up to 900 u [?], then the nearest walkable tile) when the legs' spot is blocked, and a head left on a blocked tile
# when his legs went is put there too (head_land, its tracking reset per battle). Paths relative to engine/.
# Since #62: split_hit also skips Alli's current-HP boost (stalk_boost) and Poco's overheal shield (hyper_shield_absorb).
